      <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417451024_997902_22061"/>
      <body>The Activities capability represents information concerning the management of activities. The capability allows the representation of activities and their associated methods. The figure below provides an overview of the capability. &lt;figure&gt;&lt;name&gt;ActivityAndWorkManagement_domainModel_Overview.png&lt;/name&gt;Simplified overview of the AP242 activity Domain model&lt;/figure&gt;</body>
    </ownedComment>
