          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193318_351966_24026"/>
          <body> the meaning of the assignment. Where applicable, the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'input': the concepts represented by the items are inputs of the Activity;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;'output': the concepts represented by the items result from the Activity;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; 'constraint': the concepts represented by the items influence the execution of the Activity.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;example&gt; Presence of a gas tube may constrain the execution of drilling of a hole.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
